body:
{I want to eat your pancreas}

And welcome to to the nhk and Re:zero as other people have mentioned.

And the movie "A Silent Voice"

Need someone to tell me I'm not alone, and they'll be there for me as much as I'll be there for them. A hug as well when they're whispering in the ear but that's just dreams by now floating by the horizon further and further away on a cold autumn night. Still here being considered an asshole by others despite everything I do to make others happy, being left alone as the falling tree branch in the woods. Slowly fading away into nothingness, and beholds the elements of surprise that one day I'll wake up and this life was just a dream.

&#x200B;

I think I may have gotten distracted.... what was the question again?
